106 {\cf20 // Helper Macros - IM_FMTARGS, IM_FMTLIST: Apply printf-style warnings to our formatting functions.}\par
107 {\cf20 // (MSVC provides an equivalent mechanism via SAL Annotations but it requires the macros in a different}\par
