1096     {\cf20 // - Reminder ImGuiKey enum include access to mouse buttons and gamepad, so key ownership can apply to them.}\par
1097     {\cf20 // - Many related features are still in imgui_internal.h. For instance, most IsKeyXXX()/IsMouseXXX() functions have an owner-id-aware version.}\par
